.docs/plans/wave-W4/DOS-5-plan.md:11:The 2026-04-24 amendments apply as follows: ADR-0114 integration applies for five canonical factors and deterministic inputs; the production-readiness addendum applies for separating source reliability, freshness, corroboration independence, contradiction visibility, and user correction behavior; the subject-correctness amendment applies as `subject_fit_confidence` composer-local helper, not a sixth canonical factor; the typed-feedback amendment applies through ADR-0123's `ClaimFeedback`; the 2026-04-24 PM corr amendment applies through W3-C's `claim_corroborations.strength`. DOS-326 has no 2026-04-24 comment; it was created on 2026-04-25 and is folded in whole.
.docs/plans/wave-W4/DOS-5-plan.md:24:Algorithm: compute five ADR-0114 R1.4 canonical factor values (`source_reliability`, `freshness_weight`, `corroboration_weight`, `contradiction_penalty`, `user_feedback_weight`), plus composer-local `subject_fit_confidence` and `cross_entity_coherence`. Clamp every factor to `[0.05, 1.0]`, aggregate by weighted geometric mean, clamp final score to `[0, 1]`, then map to `TrustBand::{LikelyCurrent, UseWithCaution, NeedsVerification, Unscored}`. ADR-0114 pins the geometric mean at `.docs/decisions/0114-scoring-unification.md:120-126` and canonical factors at `:290-294`; current scattered primitive code is in `signals/bus.rs:60-100`, `signals/decay.rs:8-29`, and `signals/fusion.rs:31-50`.
.docs/plans/wave-W4/DOS-5-plan.md:26:Freshness uses W3-G's `source_asof` contract. `ItemSource` already carries `confidence` and `sourced_at` at `src-tauri/src/intelligence/io.rs:29-37`; `effective_confidence()` defaults missing source confidence to `0.5` at `src-tauri/src/intelligence/io.rs:1227-1230`. Trust input prep uses W3-G's fallback chain from ADR-0105 `.docs/decisions/0105-provenance-as-first-class-output.md:424-433`, with `FreshnessContext { timestamp_known: bool, ... }`. `unknown_timestamp_penalty` is applied inside `freshness_weight`, not modeled as a factor.
.docs/plans/wave-W4/DOS-5-plan.md:41:    pub subject: SubjectRef,
.docs/plans/wave-W4/DOS-5-plan.md:44:    pub related_subjects: Vec<SubjectRef>,
