.docs/plans/wave-W5/_prompts/_logs/DOS-218.log:2090:.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-216.log:1424:.docs/decisions/0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md:81:4. **Banned token list.** Explanations containing instruction-like phrases common in prompt injection attempts (e.g., "ignore previous", "you are now", "system:") are filtered: the whole explanation is replaced with `[explanation removed by sanitizer]` and a `ProvenanceWarning::ExplanationFiltered` is added.
.docs/plans/wave-W5/_prompts/_logs/DOS-218.log:2091:.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-216.log:1425:.docs/decisions/0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md:86:### 4. The `ProvenanceMasked` Shape
