.docs/plans/wave-W5/_prompts/_logs/DOS-218.log:2095:.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-216.log:1433:.docs/decisions/0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md:148:4. **Masking has explicit shape.** `ProvenanceMasked` is defined; consumers handle `ProvenanceOrMasked` uniformly.
