.docs/plans/wave-W5/_prompts/_logs/DOS-218.log:2098:.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-216.log:1437:.docs/decisions/0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md:186:- The cap applies to the full `Provenance` envelope after JSON serialization, before any surface rendering.
