.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-301.log:422:.docs/plans/v1.4.0-waves.md:542:- **Spec:** [DOS-5](https://linear.app/a8c/issue/DOS-5) + [DOS-326](https://linear.app/a8c/issue/DOS-326). 5 canonical factors per ADR-0114 R1.4 + `subject_fit_confidence` composer-local helper. `unknown_timestamp_penalty` folds into `freshness_weight` via `FreshnessContext { timestamp_known: bool }`. **DOS-326:** retire standalone `intelligence/contamination.rs` guard; fold cross-entity-coherence into Trust Compiler as one factor (not a separate gate).
.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-301.log:423:.docs/plans/v1.4.0-waves.md:543:- **Files owned:** `src-tauri/src/abilities/trust/` (new), `FreshnessContext`, retirement of `intelligence/contamination.rs` (delete + replace with cross-entity-coherence factor in compiler), ADR-0114 R1.3 amendment.
