.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-301.log:660:.docs/decisions/0115-signal-granularity-audit.md:329:This ADR's Phase 0 is blocked on the `AbilityOutput` + `Provenance` types landing from [ADR-0102](0102-abilities-as-runtime-contract.md) / [ADR-0105](0105-provenance-as-first-class-output.md) implementation. Document that dependency explicitly in [DOS-235](https://linear.app/a8c/issue/DOS-235)+.
