.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-301.log:1172:.docs/decisions/0110-evaluation-harness-for-abilities.md:7:**Depends on:** [ADR-0105](0105-provenance-as-first-class-output.md), [ADR-0106](0106-prompt-fingerprinting-and-provider-interface.md), [ADR-0107](0107-source-taxonomy-alignment.md)  
