.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-301.log:1230:.docs/decisions/0116-tenant-control-plane-boundary.md:366:Codex flagged: [ADR-0105](0105-provenance-as-first-class-output.md) provenance includes actor metadata; [ADR-0117](0117-publish-boundary-pencil-and-pen.md) publish records include destination refs. This ADR didn't classify whether those are content, control-plane metadata, or local-only metadata.
.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-301.log:1247:.docs/decisions/0111-surface-independent-ability-invocation.md:7:**Depends on:** [ADR-0104](0104-execution-mode-and-mode-aware-services.md), [ADR-0105](0105-provenance-as-first-class-output.md), [ADR-0108](0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md)
.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-301.log:1249:.docs/decisions/0111-surface-independent-ability-invocation.md:13:This ADR specifies the exact binding pattern for Tauri commands and MCP tools, how abilities are generated into both surfaces from the registry, and how surfaces construct `AbilityContext` with mode, actor, and provenance renderer wiring.
.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-301.log:1251:.docs/decisions/0111-surface-independent-ability-invocation.md:65:6. Renders provenance via [ADR-0108](0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md)'s `render_provenance_for(prov, User, TauriApp)`.
.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-301.log:1252:.docs/decisions/0111-surface-independent-ability-invocation.md:93:7. Renders provenance via [ADR-0108](0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md)'s `render_provenance_for(prov, Agent, McpTool)`.
.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-301.log:1257:.docs/decisions/0111-surface-independent-ability-invocation.md:178:6. **Provenance rendering integrated into bridges.** Every response carries appropriately-rendered provenance per [ADR-0108](0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md).
