    25	- Evidence artifact format (`src-tauri/target/release-gate/evidence.json` + `evidence.md`)
    26	- Manual dogfood capture pattern (instructions + example artifact)
    27	- `pnpm release-gate` script in `package.json` (or `cargo run --bin` alias)
